# Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx: devotion counts only the chosen color's symbols (CR 700.5). Bot1's one permanent with a colored
# symbol is Llanowar Elves {G}, so choosing blue adds nothing; the Lotus's {G}{G}{G} and Mox Emerald's {G} pay the Elves and the {2}, one {G} left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Llanowar Elves
Forest x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Activate(Ability: {2}; Color: Blue)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Tapped = true
